  "book_id": "book-mm-12",
  "title": "5.\tAPPRAISAL AND REVALIDATION",
  "source_sha256": "f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605",
  "block_count": 1,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-12-004\" hidden></div>\n<div class=\"mm-heading mm-h2 mm-header-banner mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24118]\" style=\"background-color: #2F5496; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong> </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>APPRAISAL</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong> AND REVALIDATION</strong></span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24119]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Appraisal and assessment are often confused but are quite different processes. Each has a different role for training and should be kept separate whenever possible.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24120]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Appraisal assists learning informally:</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24121]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>primarily intended for the appraise</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24122]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>encourages open informal dialogue</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24123]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>establishes learning goals\u00a0and suggestions on how to achieve </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>these</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24124]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>\u00a0addresses</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> the</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> concerns supportively</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24125]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>guides the appraise throughout the year.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24126]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Assessment formally tests learning has been achieved:</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24127]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>tests that competencies have been met against a predetermined (minimum) standard</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24128]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>required for\u00a0continued\u00a0safe practice,\u00a0progression to the next stage of training\u00a0and a licen</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>s</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>e to work independently in the form of ARCP or 'exit interview'.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24129]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24130]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>In practice, appraisal includes some element of assessment, as it is important that clinical standards are maintained throughout the year so as to maintain patient safety. The educational supervisor (appraiser/trainer) is responsible for ensuring that a trainee does not cause harm.\u00a0</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24131]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24132]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Revalidation</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> </strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24133]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>is a process of relicensing that allows continuation in clinical practice. This applies to all doctors, specialist trainees and certified specialists.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24134]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>It aims to ensure quality improvement in patient care through personal and professional development.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24135]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Revalidation sets out to:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24136]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>assure patients and public, employers and other health care professionals that licensed doctors are up to date and fit to practice</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24137]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>test concordance with principles and values set out in Good Medical Practice</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24138]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>evaluate revalidation portfolio of supporting information over a five-year cycle.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24139]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24140]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Appraisal for revalidation</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> aims to enable doctors to:</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24141]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>discuss their practice and performance with their appraiser in order to demonstrate that they continue to meet the principles and values set out in\u00a0</span><a href=\"http://www.gmc-uk.org/guidance/good_medical_practice.asp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mm-link\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #0264CB; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u>Good Medical\u00a0</u></span></a><a href=\"http://www.gmc-uk.org/guidance/good_medical_practice.asp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mm-link\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #0264CB; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Practice</span></a><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>\u00a0\u00a0and thus to inform the responsible officer\u2019s revalidation recommendation to the GMC</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24142]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>enhance the quality of their professional work by planning their professional development</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24143]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>consider their own needs in planning their professional development</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24144]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ensure that they are working productively and in line with the priorities and requirements of the </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>organization</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> they </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>practice</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> in.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24145]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Most doctors should have no difficulty in demonstrating that they are up to date and fit to practice and should spend almost all their time discussing their continuing professional development and how to improve the quality of their practice by reflecting on their work, challenges, achievements and aspirations and deciding where it is most appropriate to focus their efforts in the coming year.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24146]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>The Education Cycle</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24147]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The cycle for learning and self-development starts with the appraisal and is completed by assessment of progress,</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>which then feeds back into planning for</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>the</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>next phase</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24148]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24149]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; margin-left: 18pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24150]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24151]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24152]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24153]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24154]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24155]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24156]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24157]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24158]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24159]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24160]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24161]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24162]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24163]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24164]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24165]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>",
